Spec: Activity type

Purpose:
  The seven rolling-sport activities a ride can have and their stored ids.

Owns:
  ./activity_type.dart
  /test/domain/activity_type_test.dart

References:
  /docs/specs/history/04-domain.md

Must:
  The types are longboard, skateboard, mountainboard, rollerblades, rollerskates, scooter and other;
    declaration order is the order of every picker.
  Each type has a stable uppercase id stored in `Ride.typ`, such as `LONGBOARD`.
  @ActivityType.fromId returns `null` for an unknown or missing id.
  @ActivityType.defaultType is longboard.

Must not:
  Hold labels or icons; those are UI concerns.

Example:
  `@ActivityType.fromId('LONGBOARD')`: longboard
  `@ActivityType.fromId('SURF')`: `null`
